  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> are square matrices such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2020</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B,</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;is a null matrix)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2020</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Taking determinant on both sides, we get,<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (as <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>)"
  }
}